{"id":"21-responsible","number":21,"slug":"responsible-decisions","title":"Decide responsibly","short":"Decide responsibly","module":"Shipping it","summary":"A decision model makes the same call the same way, millions of times. That removes noise, and it makes any bias systematic. Here is how to audit decisions about people (including the name-swap test we ran), where the reasons come from when the model gives none, and what a responsible deployment logs, samples and leaves to a person.","voice":"Jessica","scenes":[{"template":"title","chapter":"Intro","narration":"A decision model will make the same call the same way, a million times a day. That's its strength. It's also why some of those calls deserve extra care.","params":{"kicker":"Lesson 21","module":"Module 6 · Shipping it","title":"Decide *responsibly*","subtitle":"Consistent is not the same as fair.","cast":["you",{"who":"snap","mood":"unsure"}]},"start":0.5,"dur":11.388,"words":[{"text":"A","s":0.8,"e":0.88},{"text":"decision","s":1.12,"e":1.36},{"text":"model","s":1.44,"e":1.76},{"text":"will","s":1.84,"e":1.92},{"text":"make","s":2,"e":2.16},{"text":"the","s":2.24,"e":2.32},{"text":"same","s":2.4,"e":2.64},{"text":"call","s":2.72,"e":3.12},{"text":"the","s":3.2,"e":3.36},{"text":"same","s":3.44,"e":3.68},{"text":"way,","s":3.76,"e":4.24},{"text":"a","s":4.36,"e":4.48},{"text":"million","s":4.56,"e":4.88},{"text":"times","s":4.96,"e":5.2},{"text":"a","s":5.24,"e":5.28},{"text":"day.","s":5.4,"e":6},{"text":"That's","s":6.12,"e":6.32},{"text":"its","s":6.44,"e":6.56},{"text":"strength.","s":6.84,"e":7.52},{"text":"It's","s":7.6,"e":7.76},{"text":"also","s":7.84,"e":8.08},{"text":"why","s":8.16,"e":8.32},{"text":"some","s":8.48,"e":8.64},{"text":"of","s":8.72,"e":8.8},{"text":"those","s":8.92,"e":9.04},{"text":"calls","s":9.12,"e":9.44},{"text":"deserve","s":9.52,"e":9.92},{"text":"extra","s":10.12,"e":10.32},{"text":"care.","s":10.52,"e":11.04}]},{"template":"compare","chapter":"Noise and bias","narration":