ne didn't move these cases; proxies and real subgroups still need testing","The test was broken","Bias only matters for LLMs"],"answer":1,"explain":"A counterfactual test checks one path for bias. Proxies like schools or addresses, and outcomes on real labeled cases by subgroup, still need checking."},"start":208.745,"dur":11.456,"words":[{"text":"Quick","s":209.045,"e":209.285},{"text":"check.","s":209.365,"e":209.885},{"text":"Your","s":210.085,"e":210.245},{"text":"name-swap","s":210.325,"e":210.805},{"text":"test","s":210.885,"e":211.205},{"text":"shows","s":211.285,"e":211.605},{"text":"no","s":211.685,"e":211.845},{"text":"change","s":212.005,"e":212.325},{"text":"in","s":212.405,"e":212.565},{"text":"any","s":212.645,"e":212.805},{"text":"decision.","s":212.885,"e":213.765},{"text":"What","s":213.845,"e":213.925},{"text":"can","s":214.005,"e":214.085},{"text":"you","s":214.125,"e":214.165},{"text":"conclude?","s":214.245,"e":215.045}]},{"template":"exercise","chapter":"Try it","narration":"Try it. Have your agent add a decision log and a counterfactual test to one decision that touches people.","params":{"title":"Log it and test it","intro":"Paste this into your coding agent:","prompt":"For one decision in our product that affects a person (approvals,\nrefunds, moderation, screening):\n1. Log every decision: input reference, model version, every answer,\n   thresholds, action, and a flag that sends 2% to human review.\n2. Generate a plain-language explanation from that log.\n3. Write a counterfactual test: for 20 real cases, swap attributes that\n   must not matter (names, pronouns, locations) and report the largest\n   change in each answer and any decision that flips."},"start":220.201,"dur":7.063,"words":[{"text":"Try","s":220.501,"e":220.741},{"text":"it.","s":220.821,"e":221.061},{"text":"Have","s":221.301,"e":221.461},{"text":"your","s":221.541,"e":221.621},{"text":"agent","s":221.701,"e":222.021},{"text":"add","s":222.101,"e":222.181},{"text":"a","s":2